     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"宋体\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;text-align:left;line-height:19.2pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">Dear sir,<u></u><u></u><u></u></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"宋体\">\r\n\r\n</font><div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;text-align:left;line-height:19.2pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>   </span>When I use Revolution\r\nR Enterprise 6.2 for debugging “lstar” function, there is an error: has no\r\nmethod “embedd”.Can you tell me the reason or how to resolve this problem in Revolution\r\nR Enterprise 6.2?</span></div><div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;text-align:left;line-height:19.2pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">   <span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">All the best!</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:宋体;font-size:12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u><u></u></span><font face=\"宋体\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;text-align:left;line-height:19.2pt;text-indent:12pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">                                                                                                                                                              Sincerely\r\n,Wei Li</span></p><font face=\"宋体\">\r\n\r\n</font></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:宋体;font-size:12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u><u></u></span></div><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"宋体\">\r\n\r\n</font></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "IVARgE1AbKcJ",
   "from": "Matthieu Stigler",
   "author": "8c45483022d450d5",
