   "subject": "Re: [tsDyn] How to Resolve the Problem of An Error in Debugging \"lstar\" Function?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div>Does the same happen just using debug within R, not Revolution R?<br><br></div>This comes most likely from the fact that embedd is not exported to the user workspace, maybe doing simply <br>library(tseriesChaos) <br>\r\nor:<br>embedd &lt;- tseriesChaos:::embedd<br><br></div>would solve the problem, although it is a local fix, not a global solution!<br><br></div>Matthieu<br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2013/8/24  <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">chb....@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span><br>\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
    [
